<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 7.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 7.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The index at close was 4291.45, 32.37 points or 0.75 percent lower than Friday's close.</p>
